{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>LiLiCal 是一款與系統應用緊密配合的日曆與任務工具，行程來自「日曆」、任務來自「提醒事項」，重要日子則以倒數方式呈現，適合需要同時掌握行程、待辦與紀念日的使用者。現時限時免費，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-164.webp\">\n<h2>系統整合與多國假期顯示</h2>\n<p>LiLiCal 直接讀寫系統「日曆」與「提醒事項」，行程與任務不另存於封閉資料庫。內建 37 個國家及地區公眾假期訂閱，同日可標示多個地區；中國農曆、二十四節氣與傳統節日連補班日亦常駐顯示。生日、紀念日與專案里程碑可依急迫程度分組。主畫面與鎖定畫面備有月曆、日程、任務及倒數四款小工具，點按即可開啟該項目。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-180-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-181-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-182-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-183-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-184-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：LiLiCal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T13:00:38.938387+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T12:44:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:38:12.708727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:57:39.391417+00:00","content_hash":"caae77087807480dd3405994f9903c8203ab2c51ac377c80c52b165689e41e6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}